<div id="about-modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-overlay"></div>
  <div class="modal-content">
    <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

    <h2>About Adaptbase Plans</h2>

    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        This collection provides open access to planning documents, zoning regulations, and policy frameworks
        from cities around the world, supporting climate adaptation research and urban resilience planning.
      </p>

      <h3>Technology</h3>
      <p>
        The archive uses hybrid search combining semantic embeddings and keyword matching to help researchers
        find relevant passages across thousands of planning documents. All PDFs are chunked and indexed using
        vector embeddings for semantic search.
      </p>

      <h3>Part of Adaptbase</h3>
      <p>
        This archive is part of the <a href="https://adaptbase.us" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adaptbase</a> project,
        a knowledge base for climate adaptation research and urban resilience planning.
      </p>

      <h3>Open Source</h3>
      <p>
        Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a>,
        <a href="https://supabase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supabase</a>, and
        <a href="https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pgvector</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .modal.active {
    display: flex;
  }

  .modal-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .modal-content {
    position: relative;
    background: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 600px;
    max-height: 80vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    margin: var(--space-4);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  }

  .modal-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--space-4);
    right: var(--space-4);
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    padding: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .modal-close:hover {
    color: var(--gray-900);
  }

  .modal-content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    color: var(--brand);
  }

  .modal-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--gray-700);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-text a {
    color: var(--brand);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-text a:hover {
    color: var(--brand-dark);
  }
</style>
